1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,350
You already use AI to write, and to search.

2
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:08,050
But the work itself still runs on phone calls,

3
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:11,350
whiteboards,

4
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:14,650
and memory.

5
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:25,950
At three in the afternoon, someone calls the floor to ask where a job is.

6
00:00:25,750 --> 00:00:31,250
With Yara, the people doing the work tap Start, Hold or Complete on their phone.

7
00:00:31,050 --> 00:00:37,550
Each tap updates the job, right from the floor.

8
00:00:37,350 --> 00:00:44,350
So everyone sees where every job stands, live.

9
00:00:44,150 --> 00:00:49,250
Nobody has to phone the floor to ask.

10
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:54,150
Yara. See where every job stands.

11
00:00:53,950 --> 00:00:59,450
In the store, the item that moves runs out,

12
00:00:59,250 --> 00:01:04,350
while stock that isn’t moving sits on the shelf.

13
00:01:04,150 --> 00:01:11,150
Janka works out what you’ll need, item by item, from what you actually use.

14
00:01:10,950 --> 00:01:17,950
When stock heads for the reorder point, it drafts the order with its reasoning.

15
00:01:17,750 --> 00:01:23,250
A person approves it before anything goes to a supplier.

16
00:01:23,050 --> 00:01:28,150
Janka. Know what to reorder, and when.

17
00:01:27,950 --> 00:01:33,450
In the warehouse, a zone looks full only when the dock backs up.

18
00:01:33,250 --> 00:01:38,150
So pickers walk the aisles to check.

19
00:01:37,950 --> 00:01:44,950
PLExyz Grid draws your site as it really is, down to each bay.

20
00:01:44,750 --> 00:01:51,750
Every placement is checked against the site’s rules before it is saved. It warns, or it blocks.

21
00:01:51,550 --> 00:01:56,650
Find any unit, without walking the aisles.

22
00:01:56,450 --> 00:02:01,550
PLExyz Grid. Every space, accounted for.

23
00:02:01,350 --> 00:02:06,850
In the office, a renewal nobody remembered has just hit the card.

24
00:02:06,650 --> 00:02:14,650
AX Frame keeps one list of everything you pay for, and warns you before each charge.

25
00:02:14,450 --> 00:02:20,350
Every tool has an owner. Its AI proposes where to save, and a person approves.

26
00:02:20,150 --> 00:02:26,650
Start with the one that hurts most. Connect the others when you’re ready.
